I started a new game and found a stethoscope in a shop.  Using it on
myself revealed that I was stridently aligned, which I thought was
strange since I had only killed one kobold zombie.  Later I killed
another and I found that I was fervently aligned.  Obviously I had
underestimated the alignment value of kobold zombies, so I consulted
the source and found that monsters with the M2_HOSTILE flag give at
least 5 alignment points.  This means you only need to kill 3 hostile
monsters before you're eligible for favours from your deity, so I would
consider assumptions as to the hazardousness of the protection racket
inoperative.  Any class can easily get arbitrarily high maxhp at level
1.


